{#

Intro text for each contributor page, empty by default.
Override with a file of the same name in your includes directory, or with
contributor-intro/<slug>.njk for a single contributor
(e.g. contributor-intro/jane-doe.njk).

- {{ contributor }} the contributor's name
- {{ contributorAdrs }} decision records by this contributor, newest first
- {{ title }} the page title
- {{ description }} the page description
- {{ site }}, {{ navigation }}, {{ practiceAreas }}, {{ dirs }} theme config

#}
